Hi...

For a couple of days I am playing the vanilla 3.4.2 ón my Pocket PC now. The
adaption is excellent!
However, there is one annoyance - the explore on double tap (one on the
hero, then in a direction).
It makes the hero run until it bumps into something, but IMO it should stop
on any interesting location, e.g. branches, doors, items, etc.. I frequently
see my hero running across the entire level when I accidentally tapped too
fast.
Also, when bumping into a boulder, it pushes it one time, which I even
consider a bug, the game state should IMO not be changed by exploring.

Is there a way to configure this? It would also be ok for me if I could
disable the explore entirely. When I have explored the level, I can tab on
the destination point anyway to travel conveniently.

As I said, otherwise excellent port! For my whole life I wished to have
NetHack (well Rogue in the old times ;-) in my pocket, now I finally got it
:-). Thank you very much!

